{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-012-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyAutoSealPreviewTests.cs","line":891,"method":"BuildBody_HeadlineIncludesVesselNameAndDuration","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MergeDialog.DialogText.cs:82; drop FormatDuration(reFlyDuration) from the headline -> stays green because the assertion only pins '<align=\"center\">MyShip - '","what_it_asserts":"The Re-Fly dialog body headline includes the vessel name and the formatted Re-Fly duration.","why_weak":"Assert.Contains('<align=\"center\">MyShip - ', body) also passes when the duration renders empty; no assertion touches the duration substring and no other test pins it, so a duration-formatting regression ships silently.","proposed_action":"Also assert the duration, e.g. Assert.Contains(\"MyShip - \" + ParsekTimeFormat.FormatDuration(65.0), body).","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-012-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyAutoSealPreviewTests.cs","line":758,"method":"DetermineReFlyTimelineActionIsPermanent_ClassifierThrows_FallsBackToPreview","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MergeDialog.DialogText.cs:61; replace 'return preview.WillAutoSeal' with 'return false' -> stays green because the fixture passes ReFlyAutoSealPreviewResult.NoSeal() and asserts permanent==false","what_it_asserts":"When the classifier cannot predict (slot lookup throws), the dialog label falls back to the preview's WillAutoSeal.","why_weak":"The preview fixture is NoSeal(), so Assert.False(permanent) is satisfied by a hardcoded false; the fallback route and its Warn log are witnessed, but the value the route returns is not discriminated.","proposed_action":"Pass a preview with WillAutoSeal=true (reasons included) and assert permanent is true while keeping the source and Warn-log asserts; then a hardcoded fallback reds.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"ReFlyAutoSealPreviewResult","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/ReFlyAutoSealPreview.cs","sut_line":103,"case_kind":"serializer-key","proposed_name":"PhraseFor_EveryEnumMember_HasADedicatedPhrase","sketch":"foreach (ReFlyAutoSealReason r in Enum.GetValues(typeof(ReFlyAutoSealReason))) Assert.NotEqual(r.ToString(), ReFlyAutoSealPreviewResult.PhraseFor(r)); plus a non-empty check.","guards":"PhraseFor's default arm returns reason.ToString(), so a new ReFlyAutoSealReason added without a phrase case silently renders the raw enum name in the merge dialog while Phrase_AllReasons_MatchSpec stays green.","risk":"ui"}
